  - {fileID: 8637655934773885371, guid: 8748b879a5d70d34ba5dde8ab0c929ce, type: 3}
  paragraphs:
  - 'GENERAL GLORGUS: No... how could I... lose?! '
  - "COSMO: You were fighting me; don\u2019t worry it happens to everyone. Now tell
    me why you\u2019re attacking Earth!  "
  - "GENERAL GLORGUS: They don\u2019t tell me nothing, they just tell me where the
    fight is and I destroy everything in my way. "
  - "COSMO: Not this time. Who\u2019s they? "
  - "GENERAL GLORGUS: You\u2019ll see them real soon. You haven\u2019t heard the
    last of me either. Where do you think your new tech comes from? Good luck. "
  - 'GENERAL GLORGUS: AHHHHH'
  - "COSMO: Damn, I wish I could\u2019ve gotten more information out of him... "
  - "AURORA: Captain, we\u2019ve picked up a new signal. We should follow it."
  - "COSMO: Right away Aurora. Let\u2019s get to the bottom of this. "
